<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγορ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>declare, state explicitly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφῆς -ούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMagd.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὁ νόμος δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Su.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.78
			</span></i>(v. l.), <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.3d
			</span></i>; <i>give orders, command,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.437
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.291
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.324
			</span></i>, al.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί,</span> c.
			inf., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>CG</u>
				16
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή . .</span>”
				<i>forbid,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.54
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be declared</i> or <i>established,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				757a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ διηγορευμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					105.30
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				115.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>relate in detail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>speak of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶς δ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ διάφορα καὶ οὐ τὰ αὐτὰ
					λέγειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i>.</div>
